WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.200
Dad!

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.300
Oh, my darling! Happy Birthday.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.630
Dad, guess what? You know my friend Amanda?

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:19.030
Yeah.

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:21.779
Her cousins asked us to spend vacation with them in Paris. I really, really wanna go.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:28.840
Hi Daddy!

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.080
You were supposed to call me when you left.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.820
There's someone here.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.320
Oh my God they got Amanda!

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:42.000
Alright. Listen to me. Go into the next bedroom, under the bed. Tell me when you're there.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.170
I'm here.

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:48.070
Now, the next part is very important.
They are going to take you.

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:49.070
*scream*

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:54.580
I don't know who you are.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:58.840
I don't know what you want.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.670
if you're looking for ransom, I can
tell you I don't have money.

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:07.240
...but what I do have are a very particular
set of skills.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:11.020
...skills I have acquired over a very long
career.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:13.960
...skills, that make me a nightmare for people like you.

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:14.260
Where are they?

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:15.460
Ooh! Argh!

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:18.500
If you let my daughter go now, that will be the end of it.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:19.450
You have a 96 hour window.

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:20.050
Of what?

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:21.700
To never finding her.

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:22.390
No!!

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:25.090
...but if you don't. I will look for you.

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:26.590
WHERE IS SHE?!

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:29.439
I will find you

00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:30.569
And I will kill you.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:38.600
Good luck.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:50.740
* "Beyond the Sea" - Bobby Darin*

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:54.740
Well you see my son, was taken. My son was taken away from me.

